<translate>
==== MinutesToCook ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Used for food. Indicates how many minutes must elapse from the start of cooking for the food to cook.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
MinutesToCook = 30,
</syntaxhighlight>
